{"overview":"داستان انیمه برگرفته از رمانی به همین نام اثر ماکوتو شینکای می‌باشد که مخلوطی از عشق و معجزه است. دو نوجوان دبیرستانی پس از اینکه متوجه می‌شوند به شکل عجیب و غریبی به هم مرتبط هستند و هرکدام در رؤیا خود را در قالب دیگری می‌بیند، تصمیم می‌گیرند برای اولین بار یکدیگر را ملاقات کنند...","tagline":"","overview_en":"High schoolers Mitsuha and Taki are complete strangers living separate lives. But one night, they suddenly switch places. Mitsuha wakes up in Taki’s body, and he in hers. This bizarre occurrence continues to happen randomly, and the two must adjust their lives around each other.","tagline_en":"Separated by distance, connected by fate.","runtime":106,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["ماکوتو شینکای"],"crew_en":["Makoto Shinkai"],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"神木隆之介","role":"Taki Tachibana (voice)","photo":"/ut7ewXjdgUmgkhJ1EtbOo9tbc7s.jpg","en":"Ryunosuke Kamiki"},{"name":"上白石萌音","role":"Mitsuha Miyamizu (voice)","photo":"/cPydoy2sSqFDsbXeBPmzQGPmq0R.jpg","en":"Mone Kamishiraishi"},{"name":"成田凌","role":"Katsuhiko Teshigawara (voice)","photo":"/nuDFEGyuL4b1u5JUNee7WmJfgp3.jpg","en":"Ryo Narita"},{"name":"悠木碧","role":"Sayaka Natori (voice)","photo":"/a5Mkd66GV1l3c9bZZtnvjUf33T2.jpg","en":"Aoi Yuuki"},{"name":"島﨑信長","role":"Tsukasa Fujii (voice)","photo":"/qke5rZusHsjSlvB0NKlJ5dQF5D.jpg","en":"Nobunaga Shimazaki"},{"name":"石川界人","role":"Shinta Takagi (voice)","photo":"/fzjIkotjUHHs3wgftM9tqdsG8ph.jpg","en":"Kaito Ishikawa"},{"name":"谷花音","role":"Yotsuha Miyamizu (voice)","photo":"/udR4Cax2EecH3ZkATE4h6ejiGD9.jpg","en":"Kanon Tani"},{"name":"てらそままさき","role":"Toshiki Miyamizu (voice)","photo":"/eol7Ul4buAam9SmJDuFIWln0Cd3.jpg","en":"Masaki Terasoma"},{"name":"大原さやか","role":"Futaha Miyamizu (voice)","photo":"/4lAqrOmkOP3U9Owwijtvc8PaCDx.jpg","en":"Sayaka Ohara"},{"name":"井上和彦","role":"Taki's Father (voice)","photo":"/3BpYtYRiLAmTNbCm2LXlXnkMRit.jpg","en":"Kazuhiko Inoue"},{"name":"茶風林","role":"Teshigawara's Father (voice)","p